@SharePointToAzureSearch_Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

GET {{SharePointToAzureSearch_Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Microsoft Graph validation handshake
POST {{SharePointToAzureSearch_Api_HostAddress}}/api/sharepoint/webhook?validationToken=test-token

### Example change notification
POST {{SharePointToAzureSearch_Api_HostAddress}}/api/sharepoint/webhook
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": [
    {
      "subscriptionId": "example-subscription",
      "clientState": "REPLACE_WITH_A_LONG_RANDOM_SECRET",
      "changeType": "updated",
      "resource": "drives/example/root"
    }
  ]
}
